- <b><font color="#cf685c">TAGGART:</font></b> Shut it!

983
00:42:07.730 --> 00:42:09.142
Do not open the package!
Please do not open-

984
00:42:09.166 --> 00:42:11.560
- <b><font color="#cf685c">TAGGART:</font></b> Shut your mouth!
- <b><font color="#cf685c">FINCH:</font></b> Fucking Christ.

985
00:42:11.604 --> 00:42:15.085
<b><font color="#cf685c">TAGGART:</font></b> All right, Walt.
