<b><font color="#ca004b">[SIGHS]</font></b>
<b><font color="#cf685c">QUAID:</font></b> No.

987
00:42:17.566 --> 00:42:19.022
<b><font color="#cf685c">FINCH:</font></b> Don't make this difficult, buddy.

988
